  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building sustainable anti-corruption action in Tanzania (BSAAT)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce the role of corruption as a barrier to poverty reduction in Tanzania by improving the capacity and coordination of the criminal justice system in corruption cases, improving integrity and governance in the private sector, and influencing social change through research and media.</narrative>
  </description>
